arning in upper Assam. It was established on 6th Auigust,1981. Since the time of establishment the college, with tireless effort of a team of experienced ,well qualified & enthusiastic faculty members & staff, has been able to occupy a place of pride in the field of higher education of the state.\nRead More\nWelcome to Furkating College\n\"Autonomous \"\n\" ন হি জ্ঞানেন সদৃ‌‌শং পবিত্ৰমিহ বিদ্যতে \"\nEstablished in 1981, Furkating College is a premier seat of higher learning in the state of Assam. Over the years, the college has made significant contribution in the form of preparing the young generation for different jobs & professions & in making them to be responsible citizen. The people of Furkating and its adjoining area with great enthusiasm and cooperation resolved to establish an institution of Higher Education at Furkating town, the heart of a large area of 25 sq. miles. Enriched academic programmers, eminent, scholarly & enthusiastic faculty, all-round performance of its students has upgraded the college to a position of high repute. The college wishes help & cooperation from all sections in its endeavour to be an institute of excellence.\nRead More\nVision\nPreparing the learner for a knowledge society and strengthening the Socio-economic base of the surrounding area through quality higher education.\nMission\nTo enlighten the learners with relevant knowledge and equipping them for developing their level of competence through effective teaching and activities..\nUpcoming Event\n⚡️ State-Level Student Seminar on “Literature in Transition”\nTENDER NOTICE\nTender Notice Dated Furkating the 3rd Sept,2026\nTender Notice 20th May 2026\nNotice - Invites bid from PW(B & NH) Department empanelled Class-I(A),I(B) & I(C) Contractors,11th March, 2026\nNotice -  invites bid from PW(B & NH) Department empanelled Class-I(A),(B) & I(C) Contractors\nNotice - Inviting Tender Construction/Extension of Dark Room\nView all\nNOTIFICATIONS\nPG 2nd Semester Result-2026\nPayment Li